Z||000011||Wolfhound||02-24-2001||06:11 AM||||The squared off back window creates a low pressure area over the vents at speed that vacumes the hot air through the vents to cool the engine compartment.<P>Wouldn't this spoiler make it a high pressure area and effect cooling?||||reg||1
