Z||000023||rogergarrison||02-25-2001||11:55 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by gabriel:<BR><B>Hey Rog!<P> &gt;Any way Ferrari has the lip spoiler too on all 308/328's too for just those reasons<P>Where is an image of that?   I'm about to start working on creating one.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>HI, any pics you find in magazines or books will show you. its stock part on all 308/328. It sits at a slight downward angle to the back, and slightly aboove the roofline. allows the air flowing over the roof to go down across the hatch louvers and back, not to spin and go into the rear of a open sunroof. Another side benifit is that the air goes straight back to hit the trunk lid rear lip spoiler too.<P>||||reg||1
